At last, the war is over. You were incredible.
Even in pieces, you fought to stay on your feet beside the Squad Leaders and the sea warriors.

Sadly, Midranda claimed thousands of victims, and those who survived went through many trials.
I am very grateful for all your support.

The Fire Soul worries me. But we have groups collecting the fragments across the continent. I keep thinking of Gaponyeon's words, "Something terrible is about to happen", and it is not Midranda. What lies ahead of us?

I will prepare a document for Commander Derik.
Please, come back in a while to pick up the document.
